    "flavor_text": {
        "sun": "It leaps at its prey with a courageous shout. Its scaly punches tear its opponents to shreds.",
        "moon": "It sheds and regrows its scales on a continuous basis. The scales become harder and sharper each time they’re regrown.",
        "ultra-sun": "It makes noise by clanging its scales together. When the rhythm has reached its peak, Hakamo-o attacks.",
        "ultra-moon": "The scales it sheds can be molded and processed to make pots and pans. They conduct heat well, so they’re a popular item."
    },
